# Optional: T3 Connect source builds.
# This fork ships with T3 Connect disabled and never points at the official T3
# Connect deployment (Clerk, relay, hosted app). Copy to `.env` and fill these in
# only for a Connect deployment you run yourself.
# Do not add server-side secrets to this file.

# Your Clerk instance: Clerk Dashboard > API keys, JWT templates, OAuth applications.
# T3CODE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_...
# T3CODE_CLERK_JWT_TEMPLATE=...
# T3CODE_CLERK_CLI_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=...

# Optional: signed macOS passkey builds. The RP domain defaults to the Frontend API
# hostname encoded in T3CODE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY. Set the override only when Clerk
# returns a different RP ID or when multiple domains must be entitled.
# T3CODE_APPLE_TEAM_ID=ABC1234567
# T3CODE_MACOS_PROVISIONING_PROFILE=/absolute/path/to/t3code.provisionprofile
# T3CODE_CLERK_PASSKEY_RP_DOMAINS=example.clerk.accounts.dev,clerk.example.com

# Your relay (`infra/relay` deploys update it automatically). Official relay hosts are rejected.
# T3CODE_RELAY_URL=https://relay.example.com

# Optional: hosted app origin used by the CLI's out-of-band OAuth flow.
# Defaults to https://t3.bobmcmxciv.xin.
# T3CODE_HOSTED_APP_URL=https://t3.bobmcmxciv.xin

# Optional, opt-in mobile OpenTelemetry export to a collector you run.
# T3CODE_MOBILE_OTLP_TRACES_URL=https://otel.example.com/v1/traces
# T3CODE_MOBILE_OTLP_TRACES_DATASET=...
# T3CODE_MOBILE_OTLP_TRACES_TOKEN=...
